Futanari Breeding Information

Genetic Quality: When slaves are brought to Pandora, after capture, they are taken to a testing & processing facility where they are subjected to a wide variety of physical, mental, emotional, and genetic testing to determine their quality. The testing reveals the value of five core characteristics Physical Strength (aka Strength Attribute), Agility (aka Dexterity Attribute), Stamina & Toughness (aka Constitution Attribute), IQ (Intelligence Attribute), Will-Power (aka Wisdom Attribute), and Beauty (aka Comeliness Attribute). Each of these characteristics are given a value of 1-10 during testing and additional points are given or subtracted for such things as height, hereditary conditions, and unusual traits that are not easily quantifiable. Additionally, slaves with especially desirable skills or exceptional traits, may become property of the state to serve as educators, scientists, entertainers, etc depending on the skill or trait they possess and the colony lacks.

