Typically slaves that fall within the Defective category are given very dangerous but easy menial labor jobs such as agricultural work in the outermost agricultural zones. Slaves within the Inferior category are given more challenging menial labor jobs such as mining work. Slaves within the Common category are given jobs in the mid & inner agricultural zones, industrial zones, or sold as either household slaves or brothel slaves when they have higher IQ and/or Beauty than physical characteristics. Slaves within the Superior category are either auctioned off to the highest bidder, claimed by the Captain of the ship that captured them, or claimed by the Matriarch that owns the ship that captured them. If there are any slaves of Superb category they are almost immediately claimed by the Captain of the ship that captured them or given to the Matriarch that owns the ship that captured them.

