* Notes on Offspring Quality: The children of a Futanari Breeder of any sex tend to reflect the overall average attribute values of the mated parent, while retaining the overall appearance of the Futanari Breeder. This means that while a common quality mate will tend to produce offspring with average attributes, mates with exceptional attributes will tend to produce offspring with exceptional attributes. Functionally this is reflected in the number of attribute points the resulting child would have in total (I.E. 49/58/67/76/85/94). These tendencies hold true no matter the sex of the child produced.
* Notes on True Futanari Potency: The relative strength of unusual abilities or traits seen in True Futanari children produced by a Futanari Breeder tend to reflect the quality of the parent, with weaker unusual abilities or traits on the low end, and higher unusual abilities or traits on the high end, as follows:
Superb:        Either a single powerful or multiple strong unusual abilities or traits.
Exceptional:   Either a single strong or multiple moderate unusual abilities or traits.
Superior:      Either a single moderate or multiple weak unusual abilities or traits.
Common:        Either a single weak or multiple very weak unusual abilities or traits.
Inferior:      A single very weak unusual ability or trait.
Defective:     No unusual abilities or traits.

Examples of unusual ability or trait power levels: Lets take two different powers and use those as the basis for comparison. For the first example (1) we will take a healing ability where the offspring will have enhanced healing ability, and for the second example (2) we will take a related trait of precum & vaginal fluid that excrete a compound that rejuvenates those who come into contact with that fluid.
* Powerful: (1) The True Futanari might actually regenerate from wounds and injuries, even ones that are usually permanent, in a matter of hours or a couple of days in the case of serious wounds or injuries like losing a limb. Anyone that has an intimate sexual encounter with the True Futanari might have any an all physical ailments cured, begin healing from injuries at an accelerated rate, and feel better than at any point in their life before for a week after the encounter.
* Strong: (1) The True Futanari might heal significantly faster than most people, such as recovering from a broken leg in less than a week instead of the normal approximately 8 weeks. (2) Anyone that has an intimate sexual encounter with the True Futanari might begin recovering from ailments or injuries much faster and feel pretty great for around a week after the encounter.
* Moderate: (1) The True Futanari might heal a much faster than average, such as recovering from a broken leg in approximately 2 weeks instead of the normal approximately 8 weeks which is very remarkable and noteworthy. (2) Anyone that has an intimate sexual encounter with the True Futanari might experience the effects of a weekend at an expensive spa with skin treatments, massage treatments, immune boosting drinks, etc for a few days after the encounter.
* Weak: (1) The True Futanari might heal a faster than average, such as recovering from a broken leg in approximately 4 weeks instead of the normal approximately 8 weeks, which is remarkable but nothing extraordinary. (2) Anyone that has an intimate sexual encounter with the True Futanari might experience clearer skin, increased vigor, and just feel a bit healthier for a day or two after the encounter.
* Very Weak: (1) The True Futanari might heal a bit faster than average, such as recovering from a broken leg in approximately 6 weeks instead of the normal approximately 8 weeks, which is within the human norm but is around the minimum time a human needs to recover from this type of injury. (2) Anyone that has an intimate sexual encounter with the True Futanari might feel a little pep and have the effects of a vitamin supplement for a day or two after the encounter.

**Note: All True Futanari children born 'in the wild' from normal human parents who both have the recessive futanari gene have either defective or inferior levels of potency and normal human variations in attributes.
